hash b0307a5ca14bb937
note The panel tree's arithmetic and edits: the default tree holds every view once, a split opens the picker and a pick moves the view, a panel emptied by a move closes, an edge drop splits (and a panel's only view on its own edge stays), closing hands the room to the sibling and never the root, navigation reveals a hidden view next to the last one shown once per ticket, a division keeps both halves above the floor, the nearest edge within a quarter picks the side, a grab moves only past its reach, and views are named in any case.

